WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Templates”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Templates
Connect WhatsApp first, then go to Templates.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Prepare the content
Start creating a template and fill in the name, language, category, content and any required variables.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Follow the approval
Send the template for review and follow its status; use it for sending once it is approved.
